\* All TLC check configs for AntflyLmdbCommit.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyLmdbCommit.tla

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    MaxTxn = 3
    MaxPage = 4
    BuggyMetaBeforeDataSync = FALSE
    BuggyReuseReaderVisible = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    PublishedMetaHasData
    MetaWriteAfterDataSync
    ReaderSnapshotVisible
    CommittedPagesMatchActiveMeta
    RetiredPagesNotInActiveSnapshot
    CommitPhasesDoNotRaceChild
    PreparedCommitShape
    SingleWriter
    Safety

==== BadMetaBeforeData
\* Expected-failure config: meta page is written before dirty data pages are durable.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    MaxTxn = 3
    MaxPage = 4
    BuggyMetaBeforeDataSync = TRUE
    BuggyReuseReaderVisible = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    Safety

==== BadReaderReuse
\* Expected-failure config: page retired after an old reader snapshot is reused too early.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    MaxTxn = 3
    MaxPage = 4
    BuggyMetaBeforeDataSync = FALSE
    BuggyReuseReaderVisible = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    Safety
